        "summary": "Led massive expansion, adding more than 1 store every day through organic growth and acquisitions. Executive accountability for P&L and day-to-day operations of 1,200 video & game specialty stores generating $400M in revenue in Midwest and Western U.S. and Canada. Sat on lease renewal committee and evaluated new sites and acquisition targets.3 Zone VP reports. Attained differentiation in competitive market by transitioning organization from a service business to a sales- and customer-engagement-driven business that focused on successful behavior, not just results. Designed metrics that measured core business drivers, partnering in development of baseline performance measurements. Disseminated new approach to field personnel by developing E-4 platform (Engage, Entertain, Everyone, Every Time). Led educational meetings with regional and district managers, introducing metrics, E-4 platform, and correlating bonus programs. Saved over $1 Million by creating more robust expense management and reorganizing personnel. Worked closely with merchandising & buying teams to manage video game special order “open to buy” program and promote in-store."
      }
